- Parsing With Derivatives
  - Lazy (great for func langs)
  - No (possible) SPPF overhead
  - Explore/modify parser-structure
  - No problems with ambiguous / Left-recursive / any grammar
  - Great for interpreted envs
  - Good for parsing with Regexes
  - Underexplored
  - Slower
  - (Possibly) higher complexity
    - O(2^2n * G^2) original (1963)
    - O(G * g) where is |nodes|
    - O(Gn^3) - equivalent to Earley

